# ============================================================================
# Intrinsic-Dimensionality ML — .gitignore
# The repository tracks CODE ONLY. Results, caches, datasets, and environments
# are regenerated/downloaded via the scripts documented in the README.
# ============================================================================

# --- experiment results (all model/dataset/task result directories) ---
**/results*/
**/dcgm/
**/predictions/
**/histories/

# --- built caches / tensorized data ---
**/cached*/

# --- datasets (downloaded from Zenodo / Matbench, then built into id_prop.json) ---
**/MP_json*/
**/partitions/
**/id_prop.json
*.jsonl

# --- conda/venv environments (recreate from environments/*.yml) ---
**/envs/
**/venv/

# --- logs ---
**/logs/
*.log
*.out
*.err

# --- model checkpoints / serialized tensors / arrays ---
*.pth
*.pth.tar
*.pt
*.pkl
*.npy
*.npz
*.weights.h5
*.h5

# --- python bytecode / caches ---
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- analysis figures & scratch (kept outside the repo) ---
*.png
*.pdf

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
*.swp

# --- additional result/data/backup patterns ---
*.csv
*.zip
*.ipynb
**/partitions_fixedtest/
**/split.json
**/alignn_80dense/
alignn_80dense.zip

# --- catch-all result file patterns (present in every run dir) ---
**/metadata.json
**/history*.json
**/Train_results.json
**/Val_results.json
**/*_manifest.json
**/mad
**/ids_train_val_test.json
# --- probe / smoke / benchmark result dirs (non-'results' names) ---
**/probe_*/
**/restore_best_test/
**/bm_smoke*/
**/smoke_*/
**/*_smoke/
**/bench_*/
# --- source backups ---
*.bak
*.bak_*
